    "collapsible_content_TCEeNz": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_kP7dka": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can capsaicin really support my circulation?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Capsaicin activates <strong>TRPV1 receptors</strong>, which stimulate your body’s own nitric oxide production, the molecule that keeps blood vessels relaxed and open. This is a well-studied pathway. Results vary; this is a dietary supplement, not a medicine.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jgAFHc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will it burn my mouth or upset my stomach?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No. The softgel stays sealed past your tongue and throat, then releases in your small intestine, so there is <strong>zero heat</strong>. Turmeric is in the formula to help keep it easy on your stomach. Take it with food.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qUEDkw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How fast will I notice a difference?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Many people feel warmer hands and steadier energy within the first weeks. The vascular benefits capsaicin is studied for compound over <strong>6 to 10 weeks</strong> of daily use, which is why we send a 60-day supply, not a 30-day bottle.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_FCYENr": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How is this different from beet supplements?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Beet nitrates give a short 2-hour spike and rely on external conversion. Capsaicin activates <strong>your own</strong> nitric oxide pathway around the clock, in low doses with high bioavailability. Corveda™ also adds hawthorn, curcumin, berberine and more.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JXE9KX": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I take it, and how much?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Three softgels, once a day, with your largest meal. Capsaicin is fat-soluble, so taking it with food helps it absorb. No stacking, no cycling, just three softgels with whatever is already on your plate.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xwHJdL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping and returns?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Fast tracked shipping from our US facility. And you are covered: a <strong>120-day money-back guarantee</strong>, no questions. If your circulation and energy do not respond, email us for a full refund.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
